(7295742, 1137636, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but seems a little soft compared to Lik''s work.  Lik''s work seems very focused on sharpness throughout image.</td>', 'Very pretty, but seems a little soft compared to Lik''s work.  Lik''s work seems very focused on sharpness throughout image.', '2014-12-26 09:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295758, 1137264, 150277, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot indeed, I couldn''t find any of Lik''s images that seemed to use reflection as part of his image - his images seemed quite focused on all in-focus of the his whole scene.  But your trees make a really strong subject, and the lighting and color in those seem very much in Lik''s style.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot indeed, I couldn''t find any of Lik''s images that seemed to use reflection as part of his image - his images seemed quite focused on all in-focus of the his whole scene.  But your trees make a really strong subject, and the lighting and color in those seem very much in Lik''s style.  Thanks for sharing.', '2014-12-26 09:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
