(7296868, 1137604, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great image, Mark. I don''t know if this is a stitch, but I got wrapped up in the stitch route as it was being talked about so much, and tried a similar scene but couldn''t get the long-exposure water to line up at all, and it was quite a mess. Very well done here. For one shot as well.</td>', 'Great image, Mark. I don''t know if this is a stitch, but I got wrapped up in the stitch route as it was being talked about so much, and tried a similar scene but couldn''t get the long-exposure water to line up at all, and it was quite a mess. Very well done here. For one shot as well.', '2014-12-30 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 0),
